        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melan – a relaxing slice of life experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing more than a story about someone’s day.<br>With notes that rise, and notes that fall.<br>Pain is inevitable, yet suffering remains a choice of our own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time drifts in an endless spiral, carrying us through the rhythm of repeated days. Yet every dawn unveils a new hue: fleeting emotions, sudden encounters, quiet surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Melan</strong>, you step into what seems like an ordinary day in the life of <strong>An</strong> – a tale woven from everyday moments and subtle psychology. And there, you may come to realize that even the simplest fragments of life can hold a hidden depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We hope that <strong>Melan</strong> can bring you a piece of emotion – perhaps small, perhaps fleeting, but something that stays with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/eb5e74d4db36db4719772d69585e883b.avif?t=1761283171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras_big/eb5e74d4db36db4719772d69585e883b.avif?t=1761283171 width=1560 height=1040 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle slice-of-life experience</strong><br>A glimpse into school days — where teenage love, adolescent struggles, and even the smallest of moments come together to form a memorable day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/37dc93d7ae30ea88c39eb2433a9f928c.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric storytelling through subtle details</strong><br>No epic battles, no grand adventures. The story unfolds in quiet moments, evoking emotions from the simplicity of everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A personal and reflective journey</strong><br>With audio crafted for each moment, every scene resonates with the character’s emotions. Players are free to reflect, connect, and find their own meaning within the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover through interaction</strong><br>The narrative gradually reveals itself as you explore the environment, interact with characters, and piece together fragments that shape the bigger picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/d82adf322df45fa961806d035ea6ea71.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melan is a narrative-driven experience where the story gradually unfolds as you explore, interact with the environment, and connect with NPCs. No pressure, no rush — just a gentle, introspective journey through a slice of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/7b5578a8e7cea48e2c3a1fae361bb1f8.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Melan – a relaxing slice of life experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing more than a story about someone’s day.<br>With notes that rise, and notes that fall.<br>Pain is inevitable, yet suffering remains a choice of our own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time drifts in an endless spiral, carrying us through the rhythm of repeated days. Yet every dawn unveils a new hue: fleeting emotions, sudden encounters, quiet surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Melan</strong>, you step into what seems like an ordinary day in the life of <strong>An</strong> – a tale woven from everyday moments and subtle psychology. And there, you may come to realize that even the simplest fragments of life can hold a hidden depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We hope that <strong>Melan</strong> can bring you a piece of emotion – perhaps small, perhaps fleeting, but something that stays with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/eb5e74d4db36db4719772d69585e883b.avif?t=1761283171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras_big/eb5e74d4db36db4719772d69585e883b.avif?t=1761283171 width=1560 height=1040 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gentle slice-of-life experience</strong><br>A glimpse into school days — where teenage love, adolescent struggles, and even the smallest of moments come together to form a memorable day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/37dc93d7ae30ea88c39eb2433a9f928c.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric storytelling through subtle details</strong><br>No epic battles, no grand adventures. The story unfolds in quiet moments, evoking emotions from the simplicity of everyday life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A personal and reflective journey</strong><br>With audio crafted for each moment, every scene resonates with the character’s emotions. Players are free to reflect, connect, and find their own meaning within the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover through interaction</strong><br>The narrative gradually reveals itself as you explore the environment, interact with characters, and piece together fragments that shape the bigger picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/d82adf322df45fa961806d035ea6ea71.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melan is a narrative-driven experience where the story gradually unfolds as you explore, interact with the environment, and connect with NPCs. No pressure, no rush — just a gentle, introspective journey through a slice of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887100/extras/7b5578a8e7cea48e2c3a1fae361bb1f8.avif?t=1761283171\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "In Melan, the player as An will go everywhere and collect memories, thereby revealing some of what is happening in the game. The game is built in a storytelling format with situations that the player gradually discovers through interacting with the environment and NPCs.",
